// =============================================================================
// WebSocket Event Service - Real-Time Event Streaming
// =============================================================================
// Purpose: Provides WebSocket-based real-time event streaming for clients.
// Used for live updates of job progress, VM state changes, metrics.
//
// Communication: WebSocket bidirectional streaming
//
// Event Types:
// - JobCreated: New job/operation started
// - JobCompleted: Job finished successfully
// - JobFailed: Job failed with error
// - VmEvent: VM state change events
// - HostStats: Host resource utilization updates
// - VmMetrics: VM performance metrics updates
//
// Client Messages:
// - SubscribeMessage: Subscribe/unsubscribe to events (by job ID or VM ID)
// - AuthenticateMessage: WebSocket authentication
// =============================================================================

